#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:6
#: babf8831fb5547ebbde5412ed8f6bc45
msgid "How Balance Bots work"
msgstr "平衡机器人的工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:8
#: ce64599faff544568ded4db470cdfdc2
msgid ""
"This section gives a brief insight into how the Balance Bot works. Balance "
"Bot is implemented as a frame class within the Rover firmware."
msgstr "本节简要介绍平衡机器人的工作原理。平衡机器人作为机架类型在 Rover 固件中实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:11
#: 0b445d0d820f4278bdc3a0524d377cfc
msgid "Balancing"
msgstr "平衡"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:15
#: c016f65d4b4f469db820b0baddc9be7a
msgid ""
"A Balance Bot is inherently unstable about its pitch axis. If the vehicle is"
" not perfectly verticle (e.g. pitch angle of zero), gravity applies a torque"
" that causes the vehicle to fall over in the direction of pitch. To "
"counteract this, the motors must apply a reverse torque which causes the "
"vehicle to accelerate in the direction of pitch."
msgstr ""
"平衡机器人在俯仰轴方向上本质上是不稳定的。如果车辆没有完全垂直（即俯仰角不为零），重力会施加一个扭矩使车辆沿俯仰方向倾倒。为了抵消这一效果，电机必须施加反向扭矩，从而使车辆在俯仰方向上加速。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:19
#: b05084bc15904b8da6785fcea6a2242d
msgid ""
"A Pitch PID controller is used to calculate the required throttle to keep "
"the vehicle pitched at a desired angle (e.g. zero to stay balanced without "
"moving forward)."
msgstr "俯仰 PID 控制器用于计算所需油门，以将车辆保持在期望俯仰角（例如为零以保持平衡而不向前移动）。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:22
#: f27b3270c4054a1a8f604e26f2969256
msgid "Accelerate/Decelerate"
msgstr "加速/减速"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:26
#: 81c1a607e269488e87678c335b47480a
msgid ""
"As explained previously, when the pitch is non zero, the vehicle is forced "
"to accelerate as it tries to keep itself from falling. Taking this idea "
"forward, if the control system is set to keep the vehicle at a non zero "
"pitch, the vehicle will be forced to accelerate continuously as it tries to "
"maintain that pitch. To accelerate forward, the vehicle can be commanded to "
"pitch forward and to decelerate or accelerate backwards, the vehicle can be "
"commanded to pitch back."
msgstr ""
"如前所述，当俯仰角不为零时，车辆为防止倾倒而被迫加速。进一步推广这一思路：如果控制系统被设置为将车辆保持在非零俯仰角，车辆将在尝试维持该俯仰角的过程中被迫持续加速。要向前加速，可命令车辆向前俯仰；要减速或向后加速，可命令车辆向后仰。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:30
#: 086babcea5b94b1fba1a0312251d6962
msgid "Pilot Control of a Balance Bot"
msgstr "飞手对平衡机器人的控制"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:32
#: 3001eb633f3a44efac2bbf0807a273f6
msgid ""
"With more typical Rovers (e.g. not balance bots), while in Manual mode, the "
"pilot directly controls the vehicle's throttle output using Ch3 of the "
"transmitter (see top section of the image below)."
msgstr "对于普通 Rover（即非平衡机器人），在 Manual 模式下，飞手通过遥控器第 3 通道直接控制车辆的油门输出（见下图上部分）。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:34
#: f9ec4d13fe724018b75c6334440e8150
msgid ""
"With Balance Bots however the pilot's throttle controls the desired pitch "
"angle (up to the maximum held in :ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>`).  The "
"throttle output is then calculated by the pitch controller in order to keep "
"the vehicle at the desired pitch."
msgstr ""
"但对于平衡机器人，飞手的油门控制期望俯仰角（最大值由 :ref:`BAL_PITCH_MAX<BAL_PITCH_MAX>` "
"决定）。然后由俯仰控制器计算所需油门输出，以保持车辆处于期望俯仰角。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:40
#: 154c4f8c28a04dd79c55ee24d555b6b8
msgid "Steering"
msgstr "转向"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-working.rst:41
#: 99cecadb715248b1aab93db443f0db39
msgid ""
"Balance Bots have only two wheels and hence use a skid steering or "
"differential drive system. Steering is done by varying the speed of one "
"wheel relative to the other."
msgstr "平衡机器人只有两个车轮，因此使用差速转向或差动驱动系统。转向通过改变一个车轮相对另一个车轮的速度来实现。"
